      "diagnosticStartSeconds": null,
      "startSeconds": 1468.24,
      "endSeconds": 1483.18,
      "audiblePhrase": "So, what are the options? The most widespread storage technology today relies on lithium-ion batteries like those found in phones and electric cars, only on a much larger scale."
    },
    {
      "question": 34,
      "responseKey": "l4-form__34",
